    amlo:shortDescription "Adversaries typically exploit bribery by offering undue advantages—such as kickbacks or covert payments—to decision makers or gatekeepers, prompting them to ignore or falsify AML checks. This manipulation suppresses red flags, deters investigations, and ultimately facilitates the undetected flow of illicit proceeds."@en ;
